WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.060
You've had a lot of success,

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:04.080
and it's growing,

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.620
and I would imagine

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:08.000
you're starting to get noticed by people

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:08.920
from your stand-up.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:09.753
Yeah.
You're starting

00:00:09.753 --> 00:00:10.790
to get recognized.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:11.640
Have you had that yet?

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.430
Where you've had people recognize you?

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.240
Yeah
And it's exciting,

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.873
like you've had VIPs recognize you?

00:00:16.873 --> 00:00:18.583
Yes, one of my friends told me

00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:21.120
that Scarlett Johansson was a big fan.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.470
[Conan] Oh that's big.
Yeah, he told me,

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:23.303
and I was like,

00:00:23.303 --> 00:00:24.500
"Why didn't she just tell me?"

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.879
(audience laughs)

00:00:25.879 --> 00:00:26.950
"I'm easy to reach."

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:28.410
So I didn't know what to
do with that information,

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.257
'cause I can't hit her up, like,

00:00:29.257 --> 00:00:31.491
"Hey Scarlett, I heard."

00:00:31.491 --> 00:00:32.324
(audience laughs)

00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:33.157
[Conan] Yeah.

00:00:33.157 --> 00:00:33.990
"Where do we go from here?

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:34.823
What's the next step?"

00:00:34.823 --> 00:00:35.750
[Conan] Right.

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:38.170
Then I'm at a club in New
York two months after that,

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:39.610
I see Scarlett Johansson in the club,

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:40.443
with a friend that knows her.

00:00:40.443 --> 00:00:42.060
I say, "Hey, man,
introduce me to Scarlett.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:43.220
I heard she's a fan.

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:44.053
But don't introduce me saying,

00:00:44.053 --> 00:00:45.260
"Here's Hannibal, I heard you're a fan."

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:46.880
Introduce me regular-style,

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:47.980
and then we'll see how she plays."

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.030
Yeah, see if this is real, yeah.

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:50.310
Yeah, so we go up to her.

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:52.290
She says, "Hey, Scarlett,
this is Hannibal.

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:53.140
Hannibal, Scarlett."

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:54.890
She says, "Oh, Hannibal, I'm
a huge fan of your stand-up."

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:56.430
I say, "Thank you, Scarlett.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:59.030
I'm a huge fan of pictures of you."

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:00.072
No, I didn't.

00:01:00.072 --> 00:01:01.396
(audience and Conan laughs)

00:01:01.396 --> 00:01:02.229
I didn't say that, you can't say

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:05.471
that type of stuff to people!

00:01:05.471 --> 00:01:06.670
You think it, but you
don't say it right away.

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:07.503
You don't say it, no.

00:01:07.503 --> 00:01:09.063
No, you don't say that type of stuff.

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:11.920
So now, what happened to that?

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:12.840
Did you become friends?

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:13.890
Did anything-
No, well, you know,

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:14.723
she's real nice.

00:01:14.723 --> 00:01:15.670
She's very nice.

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:17.840
And two months later I'm in the same club

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.590
in New York, I turn around.

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:20.423
I'm in line for the bathroom,

00:01:20.423 --> 00:01:23.210
I turn around, Scarlett
Johansson directly behind me.

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:24.880
[Conan] She's behind you
in line for the bathroom?

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.620
She's behind me in line for the bathroom.

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:28.910
So we speak briefly,
'cause we're very cool now

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:32.120
and I think most dudes,
you're next in line,

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:33.680
Scarlett right behind
you, you let her go ahead,

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:34.670
but you know what?

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:35.649
I'm not that dude.

00:01:35.649 --> 00:01:36.668
(audience laughs)

00:01:36.668 --> 00:01:37.501
(Conan laughs)

00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:40.130
I'm not that dude, sorry.

00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:40.963
I loved you in "Avengers"

00:01:40.963 --> 00:01:42.230
" I loved you in "Avengers," Scarlett,

00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:43.130
but I still gotta pee.

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:46.130
Everybody in this world
gotta pee, you know?

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:47.253
So you held your ground?

00:01:47.253 --> 00:01:49.049
I held my ground.
You did not?

00:01:49.049 --> 00:01:49.960
I would have let her go first.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.437
'Cause I was thinking, maybe
in her mind she might go

00:01:51.437 --> 00:01:52.510
"Oh wow, Hannibal didn't let me

00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:54.340
go to the bathroom ahead of him.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:56.280
But most punk-ass dudes would have.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:58.653
I should marry this dude, right?"

00:01:58.653 --> 00:01:59.710
You never know how women's minds work.

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:00.970
[Conan] You never know!

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:04.343
Rosario looked very skeptical about that.

00:02:04.343 --> 00:02:05.300
[Hannibal] You know what, I was drunk.

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:07.720
So I think I messed up my
shot with her that night.

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:08.990
[Conan] You think you messed up your shot?

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:10.640
I was pretty faded and
whenever she would walk past me

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:12.497
in the club I would go "Scarlett".

00:02:13.501 --> 00:02:14.933
(audience laughs)

00:02:14.933 --> 00:02:15.766
"Scarlett"

00:02:17.568 --> 00:02:19.617
Conan, I don't think it's
gonna work out with us.

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:22.330
But you know, you live and you learn.

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:23.480
[Conan] You live and you learn.

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:24.313
You adjust your game.

00:02:24.313 --> 00:02:26.077
You should have learned
that in seventh grade.

00:02:26.077 --> 00:02:27.746
(audience laughs)

00:02:27.746 --> 00:02:29.663
"Scarlett"
"Scarlett"

00:02:31.037 --> 00:02:32.760
That didn't work, but you know I was just,

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:34.766
you know, alcohol.

00:02:34.766 --> 00:02:37.040
(audience laughs)

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:39.820
You can end any story that went badly

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:41.070
with alcohol.
Yeah.

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:44.730
Now is this true, that you got a show.

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:45.630
I heard exciting news

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:47.420
