00:02:49.214 --> 00:02:50.297
Is that true?

00:02:51.364 --> 00:02:53.200
This is exciting news.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.220
I have a pilot with Comedy Central,

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:56.860
but they hadn't picked it up,

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.360
