00:03:13.409 --> 00:03:15.020
(audience laughs)

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:17.603
(Conan laughs)

00:03:20.889 --> 00:03:22.910
Now did you just send
out that one tweet or?

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:26.370
Well I just...You're supposed
to follow up on your dreams.

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:28.930
I just wanted to put
good energy out there.

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.160
So you put up another one.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:30.993
Yeah.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:33.820
[Conan] This is fantastic.

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:35.280
[Hannibal] 'Cause you gotta.

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:36.113
It's good energy!

00:03:36.113 --> 00:03:37.182
It's positive energy!

00:03:37.182 --> 00:03:38.015
It's positive energy.

00:03:38.015 --> 00:03:38.848
I like that it's great.

00:03:38.848 --> 00:03:40.636
It's not lying, it's not deceiving.

00:03:40.636 --> 00:03:42.407
It's not deceiving, it's just saying

00:03:42.407 --> 00:03:45.970
